config NET_RTL819X
	bool "Realtek RTL8197F (RTL819x) switch-core Ethernet"
	depends on SOC_RTL8197F || COMPILE_TEST
	select PHYLIB
	select CRC32
	help
	  Ethernet MAC driver for the built-in switch-core CPU port of the
	  Realtek RTL8197F (RTL819x family) SoC.  This drives the CPU-port
	  descriptor DMA engine (swNic) that moves frames between the CPU and
	  the on-chip Ethernet switch.

	  bool (not tristate): the multi-object module mixes
	  module_platform_driver() (rtl819x-eth.c) with late_initcall()
	  (rtl865x_asichal.c) — two init_module definitions under =m — and the
	  /proc entries are never removed, so it cannot be built modular.
